@title Energy use at Lakewood University, FY2026
@subtitle Fiscal year ending 2026-06-30, for the sustainability committee

## Summary

Total electricity use was 12,050 MWh, down from 12,780 MWh the year before, a 5.7 percent fall. At an average of $0.112 per kWh, that cost $1,349,600. Campus-wide intensity was 19.1 kWh per square foot.

